## Strategic Pillars

### Pillar 1: Innovation Leadership

**Objective:** Maintain technology leadership through sustained R&D investment

| Initiative | Investment | Outcome |
|------------|------------|---------|
| R&D Spending | 11%+ of revenue | Technology moat |
| Patent Portfolio | 100+ new/year | IP protection |
| University Partnerships | $25M/year | Talent pipeline |
| Internal Ventures | $50M/year | Disruptive innovation |

### Pillar 2: Customer Centricity

**Objective:** Deepen customer relationships and expand wallet share

| Initiative | Metric | Target |
|------------|--------|--------|
| Strategic Accounts | Revenue per account | +15% annually |
| Customer Satisfaction | NPS | 60+ |
| Cross-Selling | Multi-division customers | 50% of top 100 |
| Services Revenue | % of total | 30% by 2030 |

### Pillar 3: Operational Excellence

**Objective:** Drive margin expansion through efficiency and automation

| Initiative | Target | Impact |
